  "description": "Chatham is built around a sturdy hand-built steel frame. It flaunts thick Wanda tires for optimal shock absorption and grip while on the road. High handlebars and a comfortable saddle facilitate an upright riding position, reducing the strain on your back. Chatham comes standard with a Shimano Tourney derailleur and RevoShift grip shifter. The accurate and responsive drivetrain makes cycling easy, while Promax alloy V-brakes keep you safe.\n\nA wider cruiser saddle, high handlebars with squishy grips, and thick Wanda tires improve your riding experience. Higher handlebars facilitate a more upright position, which is better for your back and spine.\nThis bike is equipped with a Shimano Tourney derailleur and RevoShift grip shifters. Shimano is a brand renowned for precision, timeliness, and reliability. These mechanisms improve and simplify traveling across all kinds of terrain. The seven-speed drivetrain makes cycling in hilly areas much less grueling while Promax alloy V-brakes keep you safe. They’re accurate and responsive.\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
